---
// 大頭照；沒有照片時是一個細框方塊＋等寬字縮寫（像帳號預設頭像，不是色塊）
import { getProfile, img, initials } from '../../../lib/site';
interface Props { size?: number; class?: string }
const { size = 56, class: cls } = Astro.props;
const p = (await getProfile()).data;
const src = img(p.avatar);
---
{src ? (
  <img class:list={['av', cls]} src={src} alt={p.name} width={size} height={size} style={`--s:${size}px`} loading="eager" />
) : (
  <span class:list={['av av-fb', cls]} style={`--s:${size}px`} aria-hidden="true">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 40 40"><path d="M0 10V0h10M30 0h10v10M40 30v10H30M10 40H0V30" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1"/></svg>
    <span>{initials(p.name, p.nameEn)}</span>
  </span>
)}
